# Stock Monitor sort direction button (▲/▼ beside "Sort: …"). UI only; the player's monitor
# settings (filter, sort, direction) are remembered and put back.
name Stock Monitor: the direction button flips the sort and a new sort starts in its natural direction
monitor remember
monitor close
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorButton
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
monitor-sort Symbol
expect-monitor-order az
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
wait 1.2
expect-monitor-order za
capture monitor-sort-za
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
wait 1.2
expect-monitor-order az
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSortDirection
wait 1.2
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
wait 1.2
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Price
# Sort: Change follows the pills: with ₡ pills it orders by the ₡ amount shown
monitor-sort Change
monitor-change currency
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort: Change ₡
expect-monitor-pills-desc
capture monitor-sort-change-currency
# the scrolling-list rule: rows fade at an edge with more past it (at the top: none above yet)
expect-fade FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
wheel FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows -2
wait 0.5
expect-fade FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
capture monitor-fade-scrolled
cleanup:
monitor close
monitor restore
